label s78
text Cultural club activities...? That reminds me of her.
text That girl I met at the bottom of the hill... I think her name was Furukawa.
text She was standing in front of the drama club's old room that had been turned into a storage closet...
text I wonder what happened to her after that.
text I'm in front of that club room.
text I take a peek inside.
text Last time I looked in, there was a mountain of cardboard boxes. But now they're completely gone.
text In their place is Furukawa, standing in front of a chalkboard.
text Her eyes are closed, her hands are on her chest, and she's saying something.
text I don't see anyone who she could be talking to.
text Which means... she must be practicing her acting.
text I feel relieved. She reformed the drama club on her own.
text Furukawa lowers her hands and opens her eyes.
text They meet with mine through the door.
sound GZZ.aac
text @[Furukawa]
text ...
if intF[4] == 1
	goto s79
fi
